Local changes: the MIME mapping covers the audio formats Media3 can route and FFmpeg's
native LGPL decoders handle (DTS/DTS Express/DTS-HD, TrueHD, AC-3, E-AC-3, AAC, MP1/MP2/MP3,
Vorbis, Opus, FLAC, ALAC, AMR-NB/WB, G.711 mu-law/A-law, and MS-GSM). Video is never
claimed, and missing codec-private data no longer throws. The JNI wrapper is dynamically
linked to the shared FFmpeg libraries packaged in app/libs/mpvlib.aar. The checked-in
Standard and No-Vulkan AARs use FFmpeg n9.0; the experimental MPVFlow arm64 overlay
replaces the shared arm64 FFmpeg libraries with FongMi/FFmpeg `release-9.1-fongmi` at
commit f2c5162b7c4b3e8835de270ff78cecc524decad1:
https://github.com/FongMi/FFmpeg/tree/f2c5162b7c4b3e8835de270ff78cecc524decad1
Both runtime builds use --disable-gpl --disable-nonfree --enable-version3 and carry
LGPL-3.0-or-later. The build-time Media3 verifier checks the DCA decoder, mapped
audio-decoder inventory, JNI-required symbols, and dynamic dependencies; no GPL or
nonfree decoder is added by this module.
